- Oh my God!

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:08.440
I love you.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:09.630
All right, here's the deal,

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.100
Skylar and I will each read

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.890
